トの表記法に由来する。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/JSON_vector_logo.svg/1200px-JSON_vector_logo.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_Object_Notation"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"djTJ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1c10e6c-8438-49af-b51d-5fa0ecd794b3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```  jsonlint-lint: \u0026amp;jsonlint-lint\n    lint-command: 'cat ${INPUT} | jsonlint -c'\n    lint-formats:\n      - \"%m\"```\nでも再現しないので、何も分からんになっています","ts":"1622272440.030500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DmX41"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c29ed165-27cd-4f09-8d86-552b5fabeceb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、色々試してるけど分からないな・・・","ts":"1622272356.029600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6v5+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad3d3064-8a9e-4de3-b934-148c9005cc6d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"efm側がstdinに流し込むとき何かしてるかもしれないですね","ts":"1622272111.028200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc0b0543-5131-4580-8855-d1feea9e93c2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ cat foo.json | jsonlint -c\nline 1, col 1, found: 'INVALID' - expected: 'STRING', '}'.```\nでもないのかな・・・","ts":"1622272073.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nm1zz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6d4fe1f-9fb7-44a1-b618-878f51648d03","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これlint-stdinでjsonlintに流し込んでるときにutf-8になってるとかないですかね？","ts":"1622272027.027500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_o