e","user":"U013SN4Q126","text":"出ないですね...","ts":"1622271314.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y6bh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b350d870-83cf-48a9-805c-07f6c38483ef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ひとまず行全体をmessageと判定して出るのかどうか","ts":"1622271277.021900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LykO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5c166bb-c308-4970-a1b9-999c1311bd91","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"です","ts":"1622271249.021400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pERR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc29715b-8f2d-4050-ac58-37a4789bca29","type":"message","user":"U013SN4Q126","text":"ありがとうございます。追加するところこれであってます？\n\n```version: 2\n\ntools:\n  jsonlint-lint: \u0026amp;jsonlint-lint\n    lint-command: 'jsonlint -c'\n    lint-stdin: true\n    lint-formats:\n      - 'line %l, col %c, found: %m'\n      - \"%m\"\n\nlanguages:\n  json:\n    - \u0026lt;\u0026lt;: *jsonlint-lint```","ts":"1622271240.021200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d2ff235-cf29-4632-baf1-6cf9f8eda7ab","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ひとまずこれで出るかどうか","ts":"1622271160.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SJmZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8567b7d2-ac9a-43e9-951e-c0aface80a99","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`- \"%m\"` 入れたらどうです？","ts":"1622271149.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MhH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f0814cf-8b1c-44f8-83df-82f47c93a6d6","type":"message","user":"U013SN4Q126","text":"ふむふむ、フォーマットはこれにしてます\n\n```version: 2\n\ntools:\n  jsonlint-lint: \u0026amp;jsonlint-lint\n    lint-command: 'jsonlint -c'\n    lint-stdin: true\n    lint-formats:\n      - 'line %l, col %c, found: %m'\n\nlanguages:\n  json:\n    - \u0026lt;\u0026lt;: *jsonlint-lint```","ts":"1622271138.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HhKBp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6626137-9b56-4af1-85e7-cbb14353f05f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"指定したformatで後者が読めてるかですね","ts":"1622271028.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WXzz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b18340e-7210-4db0-b8c9-51dd306af8ea","type":"message","user":"U013SN4Q126","text":"```# 不要な末尾カンマのファイルで実行\nN:\\jsontest\u0026gt;type testdata.json | jsonlint -c\nline 3, col 16, found: '}' - expected: 'STRING'.\n\n# 全角空白が紛れ込んだファイルで実行\nN:\\jsontest\u0026gt;type testdata.json | jsonlint -c\nline 1, col 1, found: 'INVALID' - expected: 'STRING', '}'.```","ts":"1622270992.017900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OJ+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca94062c-c142-4e98-be0a-5f7b0c3e3fbf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"上の例はtextlintだけどやたらフォーマットが多かったような記憶がある","ts":"1622270840.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c728a09-5213-4bb4-b6c0-82c9fe33ae69","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いや、efm側じゃないですかね\nlinterはefmの都合は知らなくていいと思う","ts":"1622270788.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013SN4Q126"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NGYL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cecdeae-9f70-460d-a96f-bc6e5a2e74b5","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"だとしたらそれは linter 側に対応してもらったほうが良さそう","ts":"1622270752.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l1I"}]},{"client_msg